<title>GERMANY: Degussa plans expansion in Asia.</title>
<headline>Degussa plans expansion in Asia.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>German chemicalS, metals and drugs concern Degussa said on Friday it planned to expand its existing operations in Asia with new businesses in Thailand, Singapore, Vietnam and the Philippines</p>
<p>It said the new units would come into being on April 1, with a 200-staff headquarters and logistics centre for the region planned for Singapore.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
